    "sections": {
        "description": "The Live Artist Theme is a modern and visually stunning solution designed for live performance artists, street performers, mural painters, interactive performers, event entertainers, wedding live artists, corporate event performers, calligraphy artists, multimedia artists, graffiti artists, pop-up art events, live art exhibitions, gallery showcases, art fairs, and creative talent promotion. Its dynamic, responsive, and mobile-friendly layout ensures seamless viewing across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while customizable sections highlight portfolios, event schedules, and live performance bookings. Built with SEO-friendly and fast-loading code, the theme allows artists to present their work professionally, attract bookings, and engage audiences effectively. Integrated plugins like The Events Calendar enable scheduling and event management, while Contact Form 7 facilitates inquiries and bookings, making it an ideal platform for artists, performers, and creative professionals to showcase live art, interactive performances, and artistic projects while enhancing their online presence and audience engagement.Demo:https://live.theclassictemplates.com/live-artist-pro/"
    },
